  - q: How many reports are included?
    a: More than twenty, covering sales, quotations, surveys, projects, tasks, support, finance, partners, attendance and user activity, plus an owner dashboard and a personal work queue.
  - q: Can a manager see only their team's numbers?
    a: Yes. Each report is permissioned separately, and data is limited to what the person's role allows, such as their own records, their team or the whole company.
